OL,7,     FPortillo gets a taste of the early
OL,8,     Flife of President Lincoln, learns 
OL,9,     Fabout Samuel Langhorne Clemens,   
OL,10,     Faka Mark Twain, and joins Elvis   
OL,11,     Ffans at Graceland.                
